{# ---------------------------------------------------------------- HOW --- #}
{# Sits straight under the 95% story: the two phase bars carry the essentials;
   clicking a bar opens its detail in place (progressive disclosure). #}
<section id="how" class="sas-how2">
  <div class="wrap wrap--wide">
    <div class="sas-how2-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">How</div>
      <h2>So we don&rsquo;t stop at the deck.</h2>
      <p>Two phases: build the strategy with your team, then stay every week until it&rsquo;s delivered.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="phasebar" data-phasebar>
      <div class="phasebar-track">
        <button class="phasebar-seg phasebar-seg--create" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="phase-1">
          <span class="phasebar-fill" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="phasebar-label">
            <span class="phasebar-n">Phase 1</span>
            <span class="phasebar-name">Creation</span>
          </span>
          <span class="phasebar-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <button class="phasebar-seg phasebar-seg--deliver" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="phase-2">
          <span class="phasebar-fill" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="phasebar-label">
            <span class="phasebar-n">Phase 2</span>
            <span class="phasebar-name">Delivery</span>
          </span>
          <span class="phasebar-weeks" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="phasebar-plus" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="phasebar-ticks" aria-hidden="true"><span>Month 0</span><span>~Month 3</span><span>Month 12&ndash;18</span></div>

      <div class="phasebar-summaries">
        <p><strong>~3 months.</strong> We build the strategy with a core team of 8&ndash;12 of your people.</p>
        <p><strong>Every week, to the finish.</strong> A one-hour review keeps every action moving until the mission is delivered.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="phasebar-panel" id="phase-1" hidden>
        <div class="phasebar-panel-inner">
          <ul>
            <li><strong>A core team of 8&ndash;12</strong> &mdash; the sweet spot for interdisciplinary work, however big the issue.</li>
            <li><strong>An executive sponsor</strong> &mdash; the owner, CEO or division head. Non-negotiable.</li>
            <li><strong>Input from across the organization</strong>, often hundreds of voices through targeted surveys.</li>
            <li><strong>HBDI throughout</strong>, giving the team a shared language from day one.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="phasebar-outcome"><span>You leave with</span> a complete strategy, built by your own team.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="phasebar-panel" id="phase-2" hidden>
        <div class="phasebar-panel-inner">
          <ul>
            <li><strong>One hour, every week</strong> &mdash; a review of every active action.</li>
            <li><strong>An external facilitator</strong> asking the questions that keep accountability alive.</li>
            <li><strong>The &ldquo;sticky&rdquo; issues get solved</strong>, because someone asks about them every week.</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="phasebar-outcome"><span>You leave with</span> the mission delivered &mdash; and a more aligned team.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="phasebar-hint">Tap a phase for the detail &middot; <a href="/strategy-as-a-service/how-it-works/">Full deep dive&nbsp;&rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

